== Controls and claim boundary
The blind reviewer checked mixed monomials, an extension-field coefficient, and $q=1$. Characteristic zero fails on $(x+y)^2-(x^2+y^2)=2 x y$; removing the field equations fails on $x^2 != x$ in $F_2[x]$. The Lean theorem does not itself state non-semi-regularity, a solving-degree bound, or a solver-cost result. Corollary 1 is a separate target.

